        { "location": "454/UI", "narrator": "CuranFormationMenuCanvas2/Panel/Tutorial/TutorialCuran12A/Panel/Message", "text": "<color=green>【クラン編成】</color>は\n、貴方と共に\n戦うクランを選ぶ場所。\n\n今回は、最も簡単に、最強の\n布陣を作る方法を教える。"},
        { "location": "455/UI", "narrator": "CuranFormationMenuCanvas2/Panel/Tutorial/TutorialCuran12A/Panel/PicArea/LeftButton/TextCancel", "text": "キャンセル"},
        { "location": "456/UI", "narrator": "CuranFormationMenuCanvas2/Panel/Tutorial/TutorialCuran12A/Panel/PicArea/RightButton/TextOK", "text": "OK"},
        { "location": "457/UI", "narrator": "CuranFormationMenuCanvas2/Panel/Tutorial/TutorialCuran12B/Panel/Message", "text": "<color=green>【おまかせ編成】</color>ボタンは\n今持っているクランの中から\n最強の組み合わせを自動で作る。\n\nこのボタンを押してみて。\n"},
        { "location": "458/UI", "narrator": "CuranFormationMenuCanvas2/Panel/Tutorial/TutorialCuran12B/Panel/PicArea/LeftButton/TextCancel", "text": "キャンセル"},
        { "location": "459/UI", "narrator": "CuranFormationMenuCanvas2/Panel/Tutorial/TutorialCuran12B/Panel/PicArea/RightButton/TextOK", "text": "OK"},
        { "location": "460/UI", "narrator": "CuranFormationMenuCanvas2/Panel/Tutorial/TutorialCuran12C/Panel/Message", "text": "組み合わせは、５つの中から\n好きなものを選べるけど、今回は\n<color=green>「ほどよいバランス編成」</color>を\n選んでみて。\n"},
        { "location": "461/UI", "narrator": "CuranFormationMenuCanvas2/Panel/Tutorial/TutorialCuran12C/Panel/PicArea/LeftButton/TextCancel", "text": "キャンセル"},
        { "location": "462/UI", "narrator": "CuranFormationMenuCanvas2/Panel/Tutorial/TutorialCuran12C/Panel/PicArea/RightButton/TextOK", "text": "OK"},
        { "location": "463/UI", "narrator": "CuranFormationMenuCanvas2/Panel/Tutorial/TutorialCuran12D/Panel/Message", "text": "これで今後のバトルにも\n打ち勝てる強い布陣ができた。"},
        { "location": "464/UI", "narrator": "CuranFormationMenuCanvas2/Panel/Tutorial/TutorialCuran12D/Panel/PicArea/LeftButton/TextCancel", "text": "キャンセル"},
        { "location": "465/UI", "narrator": "CuranFormationMenuCanvas2/Panel/Tutorial/TutorialCuran12D/Panel/PicArea/RightButton/TextOK", "text": "OK"},
        { "location": "466/UI", "narrator": "CuranFormationMenuCanvas2/Panel/Tutorial/TutorialCuran12E/Panel/Message", "text": "さて、これでだいたい\n全ての準備が整った感じ。\n\n一旦<color=green>【HOME】</color>に戻りましょ。\n"},
        { "location": "467/UI", "narrator": "CuranFormationMenuCanvas2/Panel/Tutorial/TutorialCuran12E/Panel/PicArea/LeftButton/TextCancel", "text": "キャンセル"},
